WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.667
Typography is not about picking fonts.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
It's the visual voice of your content.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
Most think it's a finishing touch. It's actually foundational.

4
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:31.000
Typography communicates tone before a word is consciously read.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Serif fonts say: established, trustworthy. Banks. Law firms. Luxury.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:47.000
Sans-serif says: modern, clean, accessible. Tech and startups.

7
00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:52.667
Kerning is space between letters. Leading is space between lines.

8
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:59.333
The same words feel completely different in different typefaces.

9
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:04.667
The most underestimated tool in design. Learn it properly.

10
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn graphic design at 0xverse Academy.

